  "title": "Stop Being Poor By 30 | Personal Finance",
  "description": "This One Hidden Psychology Trap Keeps Most Thirty-Year-Olds Permanently Poor..\n\n1. Kill The Demonstration Effect — Stop copying luxury lifestyles. This psychological bias forces you to spend money to impress fake friends.\n2. Automate Your Wealth First — Set up automatic transfers to investment accounts. Never manually decide to save whatever money remains.\n3. Calculate Your Hourly Worth — Divide potential purchases by your net hourly wage to see the real cost in life hours.\n4\n🎵 Style Funk — \"Style Funk\" by Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com), Licensed under CC BY 4.0",
